# ─── Design documents ───────────────────────────────────
# docs/ is derived from thirteen years of real personal location history:
# residence timelines, flight itineraries, photo EXIF timestamps. Even
# de-identified it stays out of the public repo, and it is distributed to
# developers separately. AGENTS.md section 1 explains how to obtain it.
docs/

# ─── Credentials and personal data ──────────────────────
# This repository is public. Everything below is either a secret or someone's
# real location history, and neither is recoverable once pushed — rewriting
# published history is the only remedy, and it never fully works.

# Private keys and certificates
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_dsa*
id_ecdsa*
id_ed25519*
*.ppk

# Credential files
secrets.json
secrets.yaml
secrets.yml
credentials.json
service-account*.json
*_credentials.json
.netrc
.pgpass
.htpasswd

# Cloud provider config
.aws/
.gcloud/
gha-creds-*.json

# Token caches this project or its tooling may write
.contrail/
*.token

# Real location data in any form. Sample/ is already excluded above; these
# catch an export that lands somewhere else by accident.
location-history*.json
Records.json
Timeline.json
*Semantic Location History*/
takeout*.zip
Takeout/
*.gpx
*.tcx
*.fit
# Keep fixtures that tests need — they are synthetic, not personal.
!backend/tests/**/*.gpx
!backend/tests/**/*.tcx
!backend/tests/**/*.fit

# Exported posters and renders may contain a real trajectory.
# assets/poster.png is committed deliberately; anything else is not.
exports/
*_export.png
*_poster.png
!assets/poster.png
